# A 1-argument builtin called with NONE. This shape crashed tychoc0 inside type_of,
# strictly EARLIER than its per-call argument checks, so the arity gate has to sit at
# type_of's ECall arm as well -- pop()/keys()/Some()/recv() all landed here.

fn main():
    xs := [1, 2]
    v := pop()
    println(str(v) + str(len(xs)))
